cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this rack in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Wall-Hung Column Rack"
abstract: >-
  Parametric wall-hung (or free-standing) rack for prepacked 1 mL and 5 mL
  chromatography columns (Cytiva HiTrap-style), generated by a Python script
  for FDM 3D printing. Rows, columns, slot size, mixed 1 mL / 5 mL rows,
  optional feet and embossed text are configurable.
type: software
authors:
